@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-8 mx-auto">
            <h1>Blazor Static SSR Form Validation Test</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                This application tests GitHub Issue #69531: Browser feedback and server validation in a static SSR form.
            </p>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <h5>Test Scenario</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>
                        A static SSR form that shows DataAnnotations validation messages in the browser without adding 
                        an interactive render mode. The form validates when field feedback first appears and how it 
                        recovers as the user types. Server-only rules are enforced on submission.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <h5>What This Tests</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Browser Validation:</strong> Client-side validation messages via DataAnnotations</li>
                        <li><strong>No Native HTML Constraints:</strong> No required, type="email", or pattern attributes</li>
                        <li><strong>Server Validation:</strong> Reserved name validation (server-only)</li>
                        <li><strong>Form Recovery:</strong> Form preserved after rejected POST</li>
                        <li><strong>Success Confirmation:</strong> Displayed only after successful POST</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card mb-4">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <h5>Test Cases</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <ol>
                        <li><strong>Invalid Email Before Blur:</strong> Type invalid email - no message should show</li>
                        <li><strong>Invalid Email After Blur:</strong> Leave field - message appears with invalid styling</li>
                        <li><strong>Correction Revalidation:</strong> Fix email - message clears on input without another blur</li>
                        <li><strong>Blocked Invalid Submit:</strong> Submit with empty fields - no POST, form stays</li>
                        <li><strong>Accepted Valid POST:</strong> Submit valid data - POST sent, confirmation appears</li>
                        <li><strong>Server-Rejected Reserved Name:</strong> Enter "admin" - POST sent, rejected server-side, error shown</li>
                        <li><strong>Published App Test:</strong> All above in published output</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                <a href="/registration" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Open Registration Form</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card mt-4 bg-light">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h6>Documentation</h6>
                    <ul class="mb-0">
                        <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/blazor/forms/validation-client-side?view=aspnetcore-11.0" 
                               target="_blank">Client-side validation for Blazor static SSR forms</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core/blazor/forms/validation?view=aspnetcore-11.0" 
                               target="_blank">Blazor forms validation</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
